### Create a new entity
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Demo using Http Client a POST request",
  "done": false
}

### GET All entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems

### GET One entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems/4

### UPDATE entity at the REST API endpoint - will replace all properties with the properties in the request body
PUT http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "task": "Done Demo using Http Client a POST request",
  "done": true
}

### DELETE entity at the REST API endpoint
DELETE http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems/2

### Update specific properties of the entity at the REST API endpoint
PATCH http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "task": "Change only the task"
}